OL,3,ANot sure what to wear for Halloween?
OL,4,AThese outfits are set to be the most
OL,5,Apopular this year
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf you're still on the hunt for the
OL,8,Fperfect Halloween costume, then you
OL,9,Fmight want to look to gargoyles, Freaky
OL,10,FNikki and Dolly Parton for inspiration
OL,11,F- they are all predicted to be popular
OL,12,Foutfit choices for 2026.
OL,14,F"People don't necessarily want to look
OL,15,Ffrightening - they want to look
OL,16,Fextraordinary," says costume designer
OL,17,FTamar Zaig, who runs a fancy dress hire
OL,18,Fshop in London and says she's seeing a
OL,19,F"real appetite for escapism, glamour
OL,20,Fand a bit of dark humour" right now.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
